con 480L, PCM70, EMT250 y Quantec QRS.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Salidas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"5,5,1\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,5,1,0,0\">2 salidas Main XLR.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,5,1,1,0\">6 env\u00edos auxiliares (Aux Sends) en XLR para monitoreo personalizado.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,5,1,2,0\">Salida de auriculares con control de nivel independiente.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Conectividad Inal\u00e1mbrica:<\/b> Router Wi-Fi tri-modo integrado (Access Point, Ethernet o Cliente Wi-Fi).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"145010000","regular_price":"145010000","sale_price":"145010000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"ARS","currency_symbol":"$","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"$","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#036;<\/span>1.450.100,00<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":43208,"src":"https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82-430x430.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82.png 1080w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82-800x800.png 800w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/FUENTE-82-430x430.png 430w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/